        "body": "Fathom is a San Francisco-based, for-profit public company (ticker: FTHM, CIK: 0001753162) founded in 2020. Its website describes it as an AI meeting notetaker that captures, transcribes, and summarizes calls on Zoom, Google Meet, and Microsoft Teams, with a free tier for individuals and paid features for teams. The company positions its core product around automatic transcription, AI-generated summaries, smart action items, and CRM synchronization, with an \"Ask Fathom\" interface that lets users search across past meetings and retrieve customizable summaries.\n\nBeyond basic notetaking, Fathom's site describes real-time coaching features and AI Scorecards intended to help managers track call performance and coach sales teams, with call insights and follow-up metrics flowing automatically into connected tools. The held facts confirm the product is categorized under notes, knowledge, and meetings, with consent and privacy noted as product considerations.\n\nFathom also maintains a registered MCP server, ai.fathom.api/mcp, described as giving AI assistants real meeting context so that outputs are grounded in a user's actual work.",
